Change 1 removes a tiny box at the top near the container lid, around (0.217, 0.096), which is not a strawberry. So deleting is justified.

Change 2 adds a point at (0.123, 0.75), which lies on the strawberry at the bottom left (the one around x 20-100, y 265-335). That is a real strawberry, and the draft likely missed it. Apply.

